## 4. DESIGN SYSTEM

**Brand color:** `#CD4419` (orange). This is the only accent. Hover/dark variant `#b33a15` / `#b53a15`, light variant `#e8541f`.

**Dark marketing theme** (homepage, services, city pages, brew landing, audit, calculator):
```css
--orange:#CD4419; --black/--dark:#0d0d0d; --dark-2:#151515; --dark-3:#1e1e1e;
--white:#fff; --off-white:#f0ece6; --gray:#999; --light-gray:#ccc; --green:#4ade80;
```
- Font: **Inter** (400–900) via Google Fonts. Brew pages add **Playfair Display** (700–900) for display headings. Homepage also loads **Great Vibes** (signature).
- Homepage utility classes are prefixed `ao-` (`ao-section`, `ao-dark-section`, `ao-h1/h2/h3`, `ao-body`, `ao-btn`, `ao-eyebrow`, `ao-label`, `ao-card`, `ao-check-list`, `ao-stat-num`, `ao-tag`, `ao-form-group`, `ao-footer-*`). Lander variants use `lp-` prefix. Reuse these before inventing new classes.
- Headings: weight 900, tight letter-spacing (−.03em), `clamp()` sizes. Eyebrows: uppercase, letter-spaced, orange pill. Orange translucent backgrounds use `rgba(205,68,25,.12)` with `.3` borders.
- Buttons: orange fill, white 800-weight text, 8px radius, 18px/44px padding.

**Light email theme** (brew issues, van issues, van signup, print pieces):
- Background `#f5f3f0` / `#faf9f7`, card `#fff`, text `#1a1a1a`, muted `#6b7280`, borders `#e5e7eb`, 3px orange top border, system font stack (`-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial`), monospace uppercase brand eyebrow, 600–640px max width. Issues are email-safe: tables, inline styles, no external CSS.

**Rules:** mobile-first, responsive down to 360px, no horizontal scroll, no new frameworks or CSS libraries, no external JS beyond what a page already loads. Keep each page self-contained.

