## 8. SEO RULES (every page)

Every new or edited indexable page must have:
1. Unique `<title>` ending `| Absolute ADAS` (Brew pages may use `| ADAS Brew`), under ~65 chars where practical.
2. `<meta name="description">` (150–160 chars, includes "Western Washington" or the city for local pages).
3. `<link rel="canonical" href="https://absoluteadas.com/<path>">` with no trailing `index.html`.
4. Open Graph + Twitter card tags.
5. JSON-LD where it fits (`LocalBusiness` for city pages, `Article` for brew articles, `FAQPage` when there's an FAQ, `Service` for service pages).
6. An entry in `sitemap.xml` with today's `lastmod`.
7. Internal links to `/services`, `/audit`, `/calculator`, `/brew` where natural; a phone CTA; the standard footer.
8. Fast: inline CSS, lazy-load images below the fold, no new blocking scripts.

Target keywords: *mobile ADAS calibration*, *ADAS calibration [city] WA*, *ADAS calibration cost*, *calibration denial*, *sublet calibration*, *windshield calibration*, *radar calibration*, *collision shop ADAS*. Local pages exist for Seattle, Everett, Lake Stevens; new city pages should clone one of those exactly and change only the city-specific content.

