## 10. COMMON TASK RECIPES

**Update monthly audit scarcity:** edit `monthly-config.json` → `currentMonth`, `currentYear`, `spotsBooked`, `spotsAvailable`, `lastUpdated`; append to `history`. Commit `Update <Month> audit slot count`. Nothing in `index.html` changes.

**New city landing page:** copy `everett/index.html` → `<city>/index.html`; replace city name, zip/neighborhood mentions, canonical, OG URL, schema `areaServed`/`addressLocality`; add to `sitemap.xml`; link from the homepage service-area tags and footer.

**New Brew article:** create `brew/articles/<kebab-slug>/index.html` cloned from an existing article; `Article` schema with `author: Mark Fowler`; add to `brew/articles/index.html` list and `sitemap.xml`; link to `/audit` and `/brew` signup.

**New carrier page:** clone `brew/carriers/geico/index.html` → `brew/carriers/<carrier>/`; add to `brew/carriers/index.html`.

**Switch A/B headline:** see §3. One variable at a time.

**Add a homepage CTA:** `<a class="ao-btn" href="#contact" onclick="navigate('contact');trackEvent('cta_click','<id>')">`.

**Change a fact (price, tier, phone, area):** update `llms.txt`, `index.html` (schema + copy), `/pricing`, `/services`, `/handout`, `/calculator` defaults, and the brew landing in one commit. Grep the repo for the old value first.

**New print piece:** add a standalone `<Name>.html` at root in the light theme at the physical size (e.g. 3.5in × 2in card at 300dpi equivalent), screenshot it in the browser; see `PRINT_ORDER_GUIDE.md`.

